<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Password - SIPENA</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>SIPENA – Sistem Penilaian Akademik</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Layanan Reset Password Mandiri</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="login-container" style="max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px;">
        <div class="card login-card">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center;">
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--warning) 0%, #d97706 100%); width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 15px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-unlock-alt" style="font-size: 1.8rem; color: white;"></i>
                </div>
                <h2>Reset Password Akun</h2>
                <p>Fitur reset password resmi dengan password standar: <strong>12345*</strong></p>
            </div>

            <% if (message) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-success" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <%= message %>
                    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                        <a href="/admin/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">
                            <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> Login Sekarang dengan Password Baru
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% } else { %>
                <% if (error) { %>
                    <div class="alert alert-danger"><%= error %></div>
                <% } %>

                <form method="POST" action="/lupa_password">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="identifier">Username atau NPM / Identitas Akun</label>
                        <input type="text" id="identifier" name="identifier" class="form-control" required placeholder="Contoh: admin / samsul / dosen / mahasiswa1">
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569;">
                        <i class="fas fa-info-circle" style="color: var(--primary);"></i>
                        Setelah direset, password akun Anda akan disetel kembali ke password default: <code>12345*</code>. Anda dapat mengubahnya kembali setelah berhasil masuk.
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning btn-block" style="font-weight: 600;">
                        <i class="fas fa-redo"></i> Reset Password ke 12345*
                    </button>
                </form>
            <% } %>

            <div style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <a href="/admin/login" style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem;">&larr; Login Admin/Dosen</a>
                <a href="/peserta_login" style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem;">Login Mahasiswa &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
